of the disciplinary authority; unless you're *really* sure of yourself, 
that isn't a good idea.  He (allegedly) verbally abused some secretary 
via telephone; when one is under appeal, this isn't a particularly bright 
action. 

In my opinion, both sides have erred grievously.

