The hidden directories are supposed to contain either classwork or
nasty notes to the system administrator poking around in them.  The
naughty bits are in directories called 'project3' and such, and any
files which might be a dead giveaway are kept compressed and encrypted
when not being used.  (with some 'cover' program which uses the
